etails":{"elite_famiglia_soldier":{"slug":"elite_famiglia_soldier","name":"Elite Famiglia Soldier","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Famiglia Soldier.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Battle-hardened, low-level mafiosi who are strong and swift-footed, worthy of being called elite fighters. When they are buried, the famiglia might send a letter of condolence home, nothing more.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt by a miniscule amount when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4400,"atk":375,"def":180,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8}},"elite_famiglia_crossbowman":{"slug":"elite_famiglia_crossbowman","name":"Elite Famiglia Crossbowman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Famiglia Crossbowman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Famiglia-trained crossbowmen with a wealth of experience. Their shots are more accurate, and more deadly as well. Famiglie always respect the ironclad order, so these crossbows are never upgraded into better models, and Arts remain just as essential as ever.","abilities":["While under the Asset Liquidation status, attacks are converted into Arts damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":5500,"atk":380,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.8}},"siracusan_civilian":{"slug":"siracusan_civilian","name":"Siracusan Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Siracusan Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"These Siracusan civilians seem to have strayed into the fighting despite having been evacuated along with the rest of the crowd earlier. For whatever reason, whenever an accident of any sort happens, everyone's wrath falls upon you.","abilities":["Gradually reduces Blood Debt over time while on the battlefield; however, increases Blood Debt by a significant amount upon dying"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":0,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":null}},"famiglia_luxury_limo":{"slug":"famiglia_luxury_limo","name":"Famiglia Luxury Limo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Luxury Limo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A lesser-seen vehicle among the famiglie, sporting an unassuming exterior but a luxurious interior. Generally, these are only used to welcome the most distinguished of the famiglia's guests, and to convey to them the graces of the famiglia's high-ranking members.","abilities":["Unloads 3 <Elite Famiglia Soldiers> if this is unit is defeated while blocked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":1100,"def":1300,"res":15,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"famiglia_heavy_capo":{"slug":"famiglia_heavy_capo","name":"Famiglia Heavy Capo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Heavy Capo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A ruthless famiglia capo who has commanded the awe of a great many mafiosi. He was there when the famiglie first rose to greatness, and withstood the tumultuous years of change up until the present. It seems that nothing can topple him now.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt whenever an enemy unit is defeated within range"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":9500,"atk":600,"def":500,"res":25,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"father_agenir":{"slug":"father